{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《愛．回家之開心速遞》正逐步邁向大結局，金城安（周嘉洛飾）與 Bonnie（林凱恩飾）的「安 Bon 戀」最終無疾而終，令不少追劇多年的粉絲大感可惜。有熱心觀眾特別節錄了「安 Bon 戀」的精華片段，重溫兩人昔日的甜蜜點滴。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-05-16h21m48s695.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026mCu0CIvFEl1785920940.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-05-16h21m48s695.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">第 214 集的《一吻傾情》，當時金城安與 Bonnie 首次錫錫，浪漫氛圍直接拉滿，成為無數劇迷心中的名場面。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"iris_lammm_1514983323_1684124641465457199_196780093.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/202655RQxL9Cer1785920983.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"iris_lammm_1514983323_1684124641465457199_196780093.jpg\"/></div></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">在第 248 集《交換溫柔》中，Bonnie 貼心地送了一對波鞋給金城安。金城安收到後開心得像個小朋友般手舞足蹈，Bonnie 見狀忍不住獻上香吻。金城安當時還害羞又怕醜地說：「畀人見到唔得㗎！」Bonnie 嬌嗔回覆：「咁你唔阻止我？」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-05-16h23m52s305.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026jugzDaE8CP1785921019.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-05-16h23m52s305.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p4\" style=\"text-align: left;\">第 935 集《手銬下的戀人》中，兩人因故被手銬鎖在一起。金城安終於如願以償，得償所願與 Bonnie 同房過夜。本以為會發生浪漫插曲，惟 Bonnie 原來十分「瞓得」，一轉眼已經睡到不省人事，更意外曝露了扯鼻鼾、流口水等醜態，場面極度搞笑，亦展現了兩人最真實的一面。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T01:38:55.186905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":425,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}